# Chordially local scan recognition. No API key is needed.
# Copy to .env; keep local paths in that ignored file.
#
# The variables below still read PRACTICEMAP_*, which was this product's earlier
# name. They are deliberately unchanged: renaming them would silently stop an
# existing .env from being found, and a key that is not found looks exactly like
# a key that is wrong. The name in the interface is Chordially; the name in the
# environment is history, and history is cheaper to explain than to break.
# Install Audiveris separately and supply the path to its executable.
# MusicXML import and example mode work without Audiveris.
PRACTICEMAP_AUDIVERIS_EXE=
